// 원문과 짝 문항은 바꾸지 않고, 비어 있던 일곱 유형의 보충을 각각 여덟 개 작성한다.
import { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';
const read = (name) => JSON.parse(readFileSync(new URL(name, import.meta.url), 'utf8'));
const write = (name, data) => writeFileSync(new URL(name, import.meta.url), JSON.stringify(data, null, 2) + '\n');
const items = read('supplement.json').filter((q) => Number(q.id.split('-b')[1]) <= 8);
const judges = { 's31-u04-b08': read('supplement-judge.json')['s31-u04-b08'] };
const mis = Object.fromEntries(items.map((q) => [q.id, 'M09']));
const evidence = {};
const typeNames = read('map.json').types;
let type, misconception, pages, position;
function group(t, m, book, checkedPages) { type = t; misconception = m; pages = { book, pages: checkedPages }; position = 0; }
function add(prompt, givens, choices, answerContract, explanation) {
  const id = `s31-u04-b${String(items.length + 1).padStart(2, '0')}`;
  items.push({ id, status: 'authored', sourceRef: { type: 'authored-supplement' },
    taxonomy: { curriculum: '2022 개정', grade: 3, semester: 1, unit: 'u04', area: '생명',
      element: ['T01', 'T02'].includes(type) ? 'E1' : ['T03', 'T04', 'T05'].includes(type) ? 'E2' : 'E3',
      type, format: answerContract.type === 'written-explanation' ? '서술형' : answerContract.type === 'short-text' ? '단답형' : '선택형',
      concept: typeNames[type].replace(/^E\d+\s+/, ''), level: '기본', track: '교과' },
    prompt, givens, choices, responseContract: answerContract.type, answerContract, explanation,
    evidence: { checkedBy: '문항 검수', date: '2026-10-17', gates: ['science', 'answer'],
      note: '자체 이론편 본문에서 개념을 대조하고 자료·문항을 직접 작성. 교재 문항이나 공식 평가 문항의 전사가 아님.' } });
  mis[id] = misconception; evidence[id] = { ...pages, task: prompt }; return id;
}
function sc(prompt, givens, correct, wrong, explanation) {
  const choices = [...wrong]; const answer = position++; choices.splice(answer, 0, correct);
  return add(prompt, givens, choices, { type: 'single-choice', answer, accepted: [answer] }, explanation);
}
function mc(prompt, givens, choices, answers, explanation) {
  return add(prompt + ` (정답 ${answers.length}개)`, givens, choices, { type: 'multi-choice', answers }, explanation);
}
function st(prompt, givens, answer, accepted, explanation) {
  return add(prompt, givens, null, { type: 'short-text', answer, accepted: [answer, ...accepted] }, explanation);
}
function wr(prompt, givens, sample, need, ex, explanation, wrong = []) {
  const id = add(prompt, givens, null, { type: 'written-explanation', sample,
    rubric: { required: need.map((n) => n.t), pass: '발문에서 요구한 생각을 담으면 정답. 공식 배점표가 아닌 학습용 기준.' } }, explanation);
  judges[id] = { need, ...(wrong.length ? { wrong } : {}), ex };
}

